MVP User Flow
A user should be able to:

Create an account
Log in
Create an avatar
Enter the social hub
See other players
Move around the environment
Chat publicly
Enter their apartment
Place and move furniture
Log out
Return later with all progress saved
If the above workflow functions reliably, the MVP is considered complete.

