MVP Principle
Build the smallest possible virtual world that proves users enjoy being there.

A successful platform with:

50 Active Users
Reliable Multiplayer
Persistent Housing
Healthy Social Interaction
is significantly more valuable than a partially completed metaverse with hundreds of unfinished features.
